+.gtca_mala:
+    ; F7: a `mala` parameter takes an address. A number, an arithmetic result, or a
+    ; name declared with one (`vitti x = 0`) is certainly not an address: an error at
+    ; compile time instead of a crash at run time. Anything else (an array, a kosh, a
